WEBVTT

00:00.120 --> 00:05.160
Long live Prince of Jin long live Prince of Jin long live Prince of Jin long live Prince of Jin.

00:05.240 --> 00:07.040
Long live Prince of Jin.

00:09.680 --> 00:15.640
Zhu Yuanzhi here you lead Beishuo Army prepare meals at third watch break camp at fifth watch.

00:15.720 --> 00:18.080
Before dawn cross Tianhe.

00:18.160 --> 00:19.560
Yes.

00:21.240 --> 00:24.960
Xie Xuan here seal all military news.

00:25.640 --> 00:31.200
Today's events must not leak at all otherwise military law will be enforced.

00:31.280 --> 00:32.680
Yes.

00:36.360 --> 00:42.040
Your Highness we still need to cover up with Prince Ning I'll imitate Chen Ying's handwriting.

00:42.280 --> 00:45.400
Reply to Prince Ning try to lull them.

00:47.280 --> 00:50.360
Good the longer we delay, the better.

00:57.480 --> 00:58.880
Success.

00:58.960 --> 01:00.480
General Chen sent word.

01:01.720 --> 01:03.120
It's done.

01:04.640 --> 01:09.320
I congratulate Your Highness prepare to ascend immediately qingzhou Army.

01:09.400 --> 01:13.387
Let them return first I will do it right away.

01:16.200 --> 01:20.120
Or have Qingzhou Army approach first.

01:20.960 --> 01:24.160
Everything wait until after ascending the throne.

01:25.160 --> 01:26.560
Right, right.

01:27.400 --> 01:28.800
Safety first.

01:43.520 --> 01:44.920
Your Highness.

01:46.200 --> 01:51.120
Who? It's me liu Nian uncle Qiu said.

01:51.200 --> 01:56.627
Your Highness's heart must be troubled tonight I thought I'd come see Your Highness.

